__pycache__/
*.tmp
# TDR-014 raw artefacts under output/ are required evidence: keep them
# committable. The repository-level `experiments/**/eval_results.json`
# and `.../eval_results_checkpoint.json` patterns target the same names,
# so re-include them explicitly from this deeper file (a negation works
# because no parent directory of these files is excluded).
!output/**/eval_results.json
!output/**/eval_results_checkpoint.json
